{title: 415 - Christ the Lord, All Power Possessing}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #415 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 415}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Christ, [C]the [Bm]Lord, [D/A]all [G]power possessing,
[G]Parting, [C]mountedheaven's [G]height,
[G]Gracious [Bm]hands [D/A]outstretched [G/B]in blessing,
[G]Clouds [C/E]received His from [G/D]their [D]sight.
[D7]Christ ascended, [G]Christ [D7]ascended,
[G/B]Christ ascended on the [Em]clouds. (on the [D]clouds)
[Bm]Christ [D7/A]ascended [C]on [G/D]the [D7]clouds.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Daniel [Bm]views [G]earth's judgment hour,
[G]Angels gathering open books.
[G]God [C]enthroned [D/A]inflaming [G/B]power
[G]For [C/E]His [Bm]Son's [C]arrival [D]looks.
[D7]Christ approaches, [G]Christ [D7]approaches,
[G/B]Christ approaches on the clouds. [Em]<i>(on the clouds)</i>
[Bm]Christ [D7/A]approaches [C]on [G/D]the [D7]clouds.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Revelation's word fulfilling,
[G]Trumpet, [C]voices [G/D]pierce [D7]the [G]air.
[G]Saint [C]and [Bm]sinner [G]fainting, thrilling,
[G]Every [C]eye behold [D]Him [G]there.
[D7]Christ is coming, [G]Christ [D7]is [G]coming,
[G/B]Christ is coming on the clouds. [Em]<i>(on the clouds)</i>
[Bm]Christ [D7/A]is [G]coming [C]on [G/D]the [D7]clouds.
{end_of_verse}
